Here's an example implementation in C:
```c
void reverseList(Node* head) {
    Node* current = head;
    Node* prev = NULL;
    Node* next = NULL;

    while (current != NULL) {
        next = current->next;
        current->next = prev;
        prev = current;
        current = next;
    }

    head = prev;
}
